Apple 🍎
1. Download or convert the app
2. Create a focus mode called "kids"
3. Select this and/or other apps in focus mode
4. Select a setting so that you have to enter your password
to open apps in this mode 
5. Check the app before giving it to children.

Samsung 📱
1. download or convert the app
2. create a focus mode on "modes and routines"
3. call it "kids" and add this and/or other apps
4. Select a setting so that you have to enter your password
to open apps in this mode 
5. Check the app before giving it to children

Computers 💻
1. download or convert the html
2. if you can, create a mode so that you have
to enter your password to open apps in this mode 
3. Check the (.exe) or (Html) before giving the 
computer to children.

Other Devices 🖥
1. Download the HTML
2. Check the (HTML) before giving it to children 

